  "mask_test_note": "Person / clothing layer, all from segformer_b2_clothes except the BiRefNet branch (same model family as lonecatone23 'LCPersonMask'). Branches: clothes / hair / limbs / person foreground / skin (= person - clothes via MaskComposite subtract). h=hair note: segformer also carries Hair, Left/Right-arm, Left/Right-leg and Left/Right-shoe, and those DO fire on anime (measured 3-9% hair, 1-15% limbs). The deeplabv3p LIP BodySegment was dropped: on anime it scored hair 0.14% and limbs 0.01%, and its 'Torso-skin' widget is actually LIP class 10 = Jumpsuits, not skin."
 },
